OL,3,GNEWSACollege 'deeply saddened' by
OL,4,Apupils' river deaths
OL,5,
OL,6,FA college has described as
OL,7,F"heartbreaking" the loss of three
OL,8,Fstudents who died when the car they
OL,9,Fwere in ended up in a river.
OL,11,FNorthumbria Police said a black Audi A3
OL,12,Fcame off the road at Panns Bank near
OL,13,FWearmouth Bridge, in Sunderland, and
OL,14,Fwent into the River Wear just before
OL,15,F13:30 BST on Tuesday. Four people were
OL,16,Fin the car at the time.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
