OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSACollege 'deeply saddened' by
OL,4,Apupils' river deaths
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe bodies of two teenage boys and a
OL,7,Fteenage girl were recovered from the
OL,8,Fwater. A boy, 17, who managed to reach
OL,9,Fsafety has been released from hospital
OL,10,Fand arrested on suspicion of causing
OL,11,Fdeath by dangerous driving. He remains
OL,12,Fin police custody.
OL,14,FSunderland College said it was "deeply
OL,15,Fsaddened" and offered condolences to
OL,16,Fthe students' families and friends.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
